doesn't make her better, babe.

109
00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:29.937
But it makes her
feel better.

110
00:04:30.071 --> 00:04:31.906
Look, I just pulled
another double
at that hellhole club.

111
00:04:32.039 --> 00:04:33.775
