2581
02:04:26.767 --> 02:04:29.003
<i>Our store will be closing</i>
<i>in 30 minutes.</i>

2582
02:04:29.136 --> 02:04:30.538
<i>Please make</i>
<i>your final selections</i>

2583
02:04:30.671 --> 02:04:32.273
